msgid "Panel Screen"
msgstr "屏幕面板"

msgid "GL.iNet Panel Screen"
msgstr "GL.iNet 屏幕面板"

msgid ""
"Settings for the TFT panel UI (glinet-panel-ui) of the GL-BE10000 / GL-"
"BE14000. Changes are applied to /etc/config/glinet_panel and the panel "
"service is restarted on \"Save & Apply\"."
msgstr ""
"GL-BE10000 / GL-BE14000 机身 TFT 屏幕（glinet-panel-ui）的设置。"
"所有修改写入 /etc/config/glinet_panel，点击「保存并应用」后自动重启面板服务生效。"

msgid "Panel service"
msgstr "面板服务"

msgid "Service state"
msgstr "服务状态"

msgid "running"
msgstr "运行中"

msgid "not running"
msgstr "未运行"

msgid "Control"
msgstr "控制"

msgid "Restart panel"
msgstr "重启面板"

msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

msgid "Service action \"%s\" %s"
msgstr "服务操作「%s」%s"

msgid "succeeded"
msgstr "成功"

msgid "failed"
msgstr "失败"

msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "外观"

msgid "Brightness"
msgstr "亮度"

msgid "Panel backlight brightness, 10 to 100 percent."
msgstr "屏幕背光亮度，范围 10 到 100%。"

msgid "Background"
msgstr "背景"

msgid ""
"Gradient background from /usr/share/glinet-panel-ui/backgrounds. \"Black\" "
"disables the background image."
msgstr ""
"使用 /usr/share/glinet-panel-ui/backgrounds 中的渐变背景，"
"「纯黑」表示不使用背景图。"

msgid "Black (none)"
msgstr "纯黑（无背景）"

msgid "Gradient %d"
msgstr "渐变 %d"

msgid "Card opacity"
msgstr "卡片不透明度"

msgid ""
"How solid the card behind a list is, 0-100. Lower values let the background "
"shine through."
msgstr "列表卡片底色的不透明度（0-100），数值越低背景越透出。"

msgid "Follow finger"
msgstr "跟随手指"

msgid ""
"Pages follow the finger while swiping instead of changing in one step."
msgstr "滑动翻页时页面跟随手指，而不是整页直接切换。"

msgid "Behaviour"
msgstr "行为"

msgid "Auto lock (min)"
msgstr "自动锁屏（分钟）"

msgid "Minutes without interaction before the panel goes idle, 1 to 30."
msgstr "无操作多少分钟后进入锁屏，范围 1 到 30。"

msgid "When idle"
msgstr "锁屏时"

msgid ""
"What happens when the panel goes idle: keep the clock lit or turn the "
"backlight off."
msgstr "锁屏后的表现：保留时钟显示，或完全关闭背光。"

msgid "Clock stays on"
msgstr "保留时钟"

msgid "Blank (backlight off)"
msgstr "息屏（关闭背光）"

msgid "Unlock PIN"
msgstr "解锁 PIN"

msgid ""
"Optional 6-digit PIN, asked for when leaving idle. Leave empty for no "
"keypad."
msgstr "可选的 6 位数字 PIN 码，解锁时输入；留空表示不需要密码。"

msgid "not set"
msgstr "未设置"

msgid "Test pages"
msgstr "测试页面"

msgid ""
"Append the touch, font and colour test pages to the page list."
msgstr "在页面列表末尾追加触摸、字体和颜色测试页。"

msgid "Weather page"
msgstr "天气页"

msgid "Latitude"
msgstr "纬度"

msgid ""
"Panel location in degrees. Both latitude and longitude are required for the "
"weather page."
msgstr "设备所在位置（度）。天气页需要同时填写纬度和经度，否则该页不会出现。"

msgid "Longitude"
msgstr "经度"

msgid "Pages"
msgstr "页面"

msgid "Page order"
msgstr "页面顺序"

msgid ""
"Root pages in swipe order. Use the entries below to add pages; drag-free "
"ordering: remove and re-add to reorder."
msgstr ""
"滑动切换的根页面列表。添加即排到末尾；要调整顺序请先删除再重新添加。"

msgid "Traffic"
msgstr "实时流量"

msgid "Weather"
msgstr "天气"

msgid "WiFi status"
msgstr "WiFi 状态"

msgid "WiFi toggles"
msgstr "WiFi 开关"

msgid "Radio"
msgstr "收音机"

msgid "QR codes"
msgstr "二维码"

msgid "Clients"
msgstr "客户端"

msgid "Interfaces"
msgstr "接口"

msgid "Ports"
msgstr "端口"

msgid "System"
msgstr "系统"

msgid "Reboot"
msgstr "重启"
